{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 47, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and rich culture. The neon lights of Shinjuku's skyscrapers gave way to serene gardens and ancient temples, showcasing the country's unique blend of modernity and tradition.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled the freshest sushi I've ever had. The bustling streets of Shibuya were also a thrill, with thousands of pedestrians crossing at the famous scramble intersection. I was amazed by the efficiency and politeness of the Japanese people, who went about their daily business with a sense of calm and respect.\n\nA highlight of my trip was a visit to the historic city of Kyoto, where I strolled through the tranquil Arashiyama bamboo forest and marveled at the stunning Kinkaku-ji Temple. The peaceful atmosphere and natural beauty of the area were a welcome respite from the hustle and bustle of city life.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a sensory overload in the best possible way. The food, culture, and scenery were all incredible, and I left with a newfound appreciation for this fascinating country. I'm already planning my next trip back, and I'm excited to explore more of what Japan has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.5286079049110413}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004159846343100071}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -5.960446742392378e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -8.22540732769994e-06}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -1.7036614418029785}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0016374287661165}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.1269807517528534}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.16147708892822266}, {"token": " From", "logpro